This is the minimal fix prescribed by the root cause analysis. The Contentstack SDK natively supports the `live_preview` config in `Stack()` — no new functions, classes, or architecture changes are needed. When `CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_TOKEN` is not set, `enable` is `false` and the app behaves exactly as before (delivery-only mode). When it is set, the SDK will serve draft/preview content for live-preview sessions.
